    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d469">

                <pb facs="0844" n="744" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg744"/>

                <head>No. 469.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Weill to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-04-12"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 12, 1880</date>.
                        (Received May 3.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 7.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to department’s No. 727, I have
                    to state that I informed the Mexican minister of foreign affairs of the repeal
                    of the order issued to General Ord by the War Department under date of June 1,
                    1877, and in reply I received from Mr. Ruelas the note of which I herewith
                    inclose a copy.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>EDWARD M. NEILL.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d469-a1.xml" xpointer="d469-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
